          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.100:block:6",
          "start": 1909
        },
        "quote": "(c) Extension of Time to Connect. The City Manager may extend the time to make connection with the public sanitary sewer if City-administered loan money for qualifying property owners is not available at the written request of the person owning the dwelling or other building and the requester is a qualified property owner. (Ord. 20089 § 42, 10-17-17.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.100:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
